{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026lneHBZpgX71792990785.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西半山羅便臣道33號分行首席分區營業經理余慕賢表示，分行新近促成上環太平大廈買賣成交，單位為低層D室，實用面積495平方呎，採2房間隔，望街景。單位屬遺產物業，最新以530萬元成交，折合實用呎價10,707元。</p><p><br/>據了解，新買家為用家，心儀上址周邊生活配套完善，單位間隔四正實用，見造價合適遂迅速決定入市自用。原業主於早期買入單位，是次沽出預料賬面獲利甚豐。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:42:36.996155+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T22:38:09.756011+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T09:38:46.752845+00:00","content_hash":"54d10aadea3364c498e68ac5510827550c0759e41ec2e764036903cc4f667bf5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:42:36.996155+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}